Third-party software
--------------------
Installed from source or as a Python package (pip), SMneg uses these libraries,
installed separately under their own licenses:

  PySide6 / Qt for Python   LGPL-3.0 (https://www.qt.io/qt-for-python)
  rawpy                     MIT, with LibRaw (LGPL-2.1 or CDDL-1.0)
  opencv-python             Apache-2.0 (bundles third-party code under its own licenses)
  NumPy                     BSD-3-Clause
  Pillow                    MIT-CMU (HPND), with Little CMS (MIT)
  tifffile                  BSD-3-Clause

The pre-built applications (macOS .dmg, Windows .zip) are made with PyInstaller
and contain copies of these libraries, unmodified. Their license files are
included in the application (package metadata folders). Qt / PySide6 and LibRaw
are dynamically linked libraries that you may replace with your own builds
under the terms of the LGPL. Their source code is available from the projects
above.
